{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 39","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Corey shops for apples and bananas. Apples cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/9/b99b9d98130a63c18ffa6e4ab77d21d1f052f516.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$0.90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> each, and bananas cost <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/f/befbca36a411bf500a56f6def9d2882210057eeb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$0.45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> each. If he buys a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> pieces of fruit and spends <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/8/548449edef6f356497f86f09cf9560103142d19e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$4.50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />, how many apples did he buy?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/b/56ba4689e3ad4bdc647d8d1dd2333eb513a12d95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\  2 \\text{ apples} \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\  3 \\text{ apples}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\  4 \\text{ apples}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\  5 \\text{ apples}\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\  6 \\text{ apples} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"638\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of apples he bought. Since he bought <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> pieces of fruit, he bought <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/3/6d3571c8fa9393175fd4e74a46b6a3d9bb1d79c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 - a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"15\" /> bananas. He spent <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/8/548449edef6f356497f86f09cf9560103142d19e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$4.50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> in total, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/9/c292f7ae4a87297474cdbc0441ac29e04d317ddd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$0.90a + \\$0.45(7 - a) = \\$4.50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"237\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/c/67ce266e39a09684136fa0129f1f71b91ce63ef2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\$0.90a + \\$0.45(7 - a)}{\\$0.45} = \\frac{\\$4.50}{\\$0.45}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"245\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/0/94084fa8e952d79a91690d982d27163d79b9da79.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a + 7 - a = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"126\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/4/2b44acbfff809d01d421bb00287a3a1926a83f6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + 7 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>a = 10 - 7 = \\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } 3 \\text{ apples}}$.\n</p><p>¬anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra I</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Answer_Key\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 38\">Problem 38</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 40\">Problem 40</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 TMTA 